{"path":"std/fs/fn.create_dir.html","title":"Function create_dir","description":"Creates a new, empty directory at the provided path.","body":{"type":"document","children":[{"type":"anchor","id":"main-content"},{"type":"heading","level":1,"id":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function create_dir"}]},{"type":"text","value":"1.0.0 · "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/src/std/fs.rs.html#3030-3032","title":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Source"}]},{"type":"code_block","language":null,"code":"pub fn create_dir<P: AsRef<Path>>(path: P) -> Result<()>"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a new, empty directory at the provided path."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"id":"platform-specific-behavior","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Platform-specific behavior"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function currently corresponds to the "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"mkdir"},{"type":"text","value":" function on Unix and the "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"CreateDirectoryW"},{"type":"text","value":" function on Windows. Note that, this "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/io/index.html#platform-specific-behavior","title":"mod std::io","children":[{"type":"text","value":"may change in the future"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NOTE"}]},{"type":"text","value":": If a parent of the given path doesn’t exist, this function will return an error. To create a directory and all its missing parents at the same time, use the "},{"type":"link","href":"std/fs/fn.create_dir_all.html","title":"fn std::fs::create_dir_all","children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"create_dir_all"}]},{"type":"text","value":" function."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"id":"errors","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Errors"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function will return an error in the following situations, but is not limited to just these cases:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"start":null,"items":[{"children":[{"type":"text","value":"User lacks permissions to create directory at "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"path"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A parent of the given path doesn’t exist. (To create a directory and all its missing parents at the same time, use the "},{"type":"link","href":"std/fs/fn.create_dir_all.html","title":"fn std::fs::create_dir_all","children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"create_dir_all"}]},{"type":"text","value":" function.)"}]},{"children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"path"},{"type":"text","value":" already exists."}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code_block","language":null,"code":"use std::fs;\n\nfn main() -> std::io::Result<()> {\n    fs::create_dir(\"/some/dir\")?;\n    Ok(())\n}"},{"type":"link","href":"https://play.rust-lang.org/?code=%23!%5Ballow(unused)%5D%0Ause+std::fs;%0A%0Afn+main()+-%3E+std::io::Result%3C()%3E+%7B%0A++++fs::create_dir(%22/some/dir%22)?;%0A++++Ok(())%0A%7D&edition=2024","title":"Run code","children":[]}]}}
